00:27:55.173 --> 00:27:58.376 line:0%
THAT HAVE BEEN SHOWN TO
DILATE YOUR SENSE OF TIME.

00:27:58.476 --> 00:28:00.678 line:0%
THAT'S WHY FOR MOST
PEOPLE THE FIRST CLIP SEEMS

00:28:00.778 --> 00:28:04.916 line:0%
