00:28:05.016 --> 00:28:07.685 line:0%
BUT IS IT POSSIBLE
TO STOP TIME ENTIRELY?

00:28:07.785 --> 00:28:10.054 line:0%
USING HIS MASTER
MENTALIST SKILLS,

00:28:10.154 --> 00:28:13.091 line:0%
MARC SALEM IS TRYING TO
STOP AND EVEN CHANGE HOW

00:28:13.191 --> 00:28:15.159 line:0%
