00:32:11.162 --> 00:32:12.997 line:0%
IT'S LIKE THOSE 2 WEEKS
CARVED A NEW NEURAL PATHWAY

00:32:13.097 --> 00:32:15.400 line:0%
IN YOUR BRAIN AND ALL OF A
SUDDEN THIS BECAME UNNATURAL.

00:32:15.500 --> 00:32:16.534 line:0%
