00:32:16.634 --> 00:32:18.469 line:0%
DR. MURRAY: SO THIS IS A
REALLY INCREDIBLE EXAMPLE OF

00:32:18.569 --> 00:32:20.204 line:0%
WHAT WE CALL NEUROPLASTICITY.

00:32:20.304 --> 00:32:23.274 line:0%
SO RESEARCHERS HAVE FOUND
THAT YOUR ABILITY TO LEARN AND

00:32:23.374 --> 00:32:26.009 line:0%
RELEARN DIFFERENT MOTOR TASKS
ARE LINKED TO A PARTICULAR

00:32:26.109 --> 00:32:27.879 line:0%
PART OF THE BRAIN
CALLED THE CEREBELLUM.

00:32:27.979 --> 00:32:30.614 line:0%
AND WHAT THIS AREA DOES
IS IT COMPARES WHAT WE ARE

00:32:30.715 --> 00:32:33.551 line:0%
TRYING TO DO WITH WHAT WE'VE
DONE IN OUR PAST.

00:32:33.651 --> 00:32:36.688 line:0%
AND SO IT SLOWLY
UPDATES THE PATHWAYS AS WE

00:32:36.788 --> 00:32:38.355 line:0%
LEARN NEW SKILLS.

00:32:38.456 --> 00:32:40.190 line:0%
SO NOW YOU'RE STUCK
WITH THIS NEW PATHWAY AND

00:32:40.290 --> 00:32:41.759 line:0%
IT'S DIFFICULT
TO RIDE YOUR BIKE.

