CHANGE THIS TIME?

00:33:43.921 --> 00:33:45.122 line:0%
REMEMBER YOUR ANSWERS.

00:33:45.222 --> 00:33:46.858 line:0%
IT'S TIME FOR OUR FINAL ROUND.

00:33:50.561 --> 00:33:54.032 line:0%
SO WHICH ROUNDS DID YOU
SAY HAD CHANGING DOTS?

00:33:55.099 --> 00:33:58.769 line:0%
