YOU'RE RIGHT.

00:33:59.169 --> 00:34:01.806 line:0%
THERE WAS NO
CHANGE IN ROUND 2.

00:34:01.906 --> 00:34:05.643 line:0%
IF WE ASKED YOU WHICH
EXACT DOTS EXACTLY CHANGED,

00:34:05.743 --> 00:34:07.779 line:0%
THAT MIGHT BE TOO MUCH
FOR YOUR BRAIN TO HANDLE.

00:34:07.879 --> 00:34:10.915 line:0%
BUT STUDIES SHOW, MOST
PEOPLE SAY THE IMAGE CHANGES

00:34:11.015 --> 00:34:14.652 line:0%
