EXACTLY WHAT HAS CHANGED.

00:34:14.919 --> 00:34:17.488 line:0%
YOU MIGHT SAY THOSE OF
YOU WHO ANSWERED CORRECTLY

00:34:17.588 --> 00:34:20.558 line:0%
SENSED SOMETHING YOU
DIDN'T ACTUALLY SEE.

00:34:21.458 --> 00:34:23.460 line:0%
DOES THAT SOUND
LIKE A SIXTH SENSE?

00:34:23.560 --> 00:34:27.265 line:0%
OUR SUPER SENSEI MASTER MARC,
HAS DEVELOPED HIS SUPER-SENSE

00:34:27.365 --> 00:34:29.200 line:0%
OF MICRO-OBSERVATION,

00:34:29.300 --> 00:34:31.435 line:0%
THE ABILITY TO SENSE
WHAT OTHERS CANNOT,

00:34:31.535 --> 00:34:35.840 line:0%
TO READ MINUTE DETAILS OF
BODY LANGUAGE AND ATTITUDE.

