MARC: YOUR FIFTEEN
SECONDS BEGINS NOW.

00:35:18.515 --> 00:35:21.451 line:0%
YOU SHOULD BE DRAWING
ALREADY, BECAUSE ALREADY.

00:35:21.551 --> 00:35:23.854 line:0%
SEVEN, SIX, COME ON
